(b)  [The applicant’s relatives] who had witnessed the events have not been questioned, in spite of the fact that they could assist in establishing the factual circumstances of the events;
(c)  The investigators failed to examine the circumstances surrounding the [disappearance] of the GAZ-53’s tailgate, which, according to the witnesses, had fallen off the lorry after the military servicemen had finished the special operation and had been driving away;
